From 2135563bce6ff1b65e24c3343a688804a6c08aaf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 09:37:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Lost Isles headless - phases, jumps, rides, robustness
 (F-219)

- move: self-addressed monster moves set our position and are reported back
  with MSG_MOVE_FALL_LAND (player splines are client-flown: rocket boots, drops)
- start_area.py: phase-aware spawn choice (visible spawns -> last known ->
  PhaseMgr-equivalent quest_phase); jump items (spell_target_position) as a
  travel fallback; wait out vehicle rides (aura 236) before turning in;
  over-long routes split; off-navmesh targets approached by nearby points or a
  straight walk; KillCredit aliases; summons beside spawned hosts; GO data-field
  kill credit; summoned rides; refused-quest retries; accept/turn-in/trainer
  failures non-fatal; SIGTERM sender trace
- rpc.py: restore proto3-omitted zeros; supervise.sh: liveness-checked verdicts,
  exit codes, exec'd session launch

Refs F-219

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
